    "detailed_description": "&quot;Saddle Up and Drive&quot; is a game set in the 1970s, where you play as the reckless nephew of an old car driver, now an alcoholic deeply in debt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find a way to earn your daily wage: smuggle (but don't get caught!), make good deals, or help the community.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can participate in various challenges, winning a lot of cash if you're capable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/272f9fc95fec9a705381f01e5ceb329e.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/272f9fc95fec9a705381f01e5ceb329e.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/272f9fc95fec9a705381f01e5ceb329e.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A multitude of different vehicles await you, each with its own peculiar characteristics. Choose the most suitable vehicle for the mission you intend to undertake!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/769cc205d3c95e86a6d243637bc2fdf7.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/769cc205d3c95e86a6d243637bc2fdf7.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/769cc205d3c95e86a6d243637bc2fdf7.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore a vast open world, consisting of 4 large maps of about 50 km\u00b2 each, plus a lot of extra levels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/e3a8e298a67447f86b42a3331ecf3a6f.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/e3a8e298a67447f86b42a3331ecf3a6f.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/e3a8e298a67447f86b42a3331ecf3a6f.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And remember! This game is best played with a controller, but you can still use a mouse and keyboard.<br>Saddle Up and Drive is constantly being developed. Stay updated! Click 'Follow' on this page!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/7681a7cd1375fffc9df5ac10b524082d.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/7681a7cd1375fffc9df5ac10b524082d.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/7681a7cd1375fffc9df5ac10b524082d.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Saddle Up and Drive&quot; is a game set in the 1970s, where you play as the reckless nephew of an old car driver, now an alcoholic deeply in debt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find a way to earn your daily wage: smuggle (but don't get caught!), make good deals, or help the community.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can participate in various challenges, winning a lot of cash if you're capable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/272f9fc95fec9a705381f01e5ceb329e.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/272f9fc95fec9a705381f01e5ceb329e.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/272f9fc95fec9a705381f01e5ceb329e.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A multitude of different vehicles await you, each with its own peculiar characteristics. Choose the most suitable vehicle for the mission you intend to undertake!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/769cc205d3c95e86a6d243637bc2fdf7.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/769cc205d3c95e86a6d243637bc2fdf7.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/769cc205d3c95e86a6d243637bc2fdf7.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore a vast open world, consisting of 4 large maps of about 50 km\u00b2 each, plus a lot of extra levels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/e3a8e298a67447f86b42a3331ecf3a6f.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/e3a8e298a67447f86b42a3331ecf3a6f.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/e3a8e298a67447f86b42a3331ecf3a6f.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And remember! This game is best played with a controller, but you can still use a mouse and keyboard.<br>Saddle Up and Drive is constantly being developed. Stay updated! Click 'Follow' on this page!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/7681a7cd1375fffc9df5ac10b524082d.poster.avif?t=1754053765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/7681a7cd1375fffc9df5ac10b524082d.webm?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/7681a7cd1375fffc9df5ac10b524082d.mp4?t=1754053765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
